"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/panama","read":"2026-08-20T14:55:13Z","source_updated":"2025-12-10T13:26:25+00:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07","long_tail":["boquete panama things to do","volcan baru hike guide altitude","panama geisha coffee tour boquete","los quetzales trail quetzal season","chiriqui viejo whitewater rafting","caldera hot springs boquete","boquete flower and coffee fair","how to get from panama city to boquete"]},"source_verified":true,"ingested_from":"output/boquete-panama.md","orbit":[{"id":"bocas-del-toro-panama","jewels":13,"si":["tropical","diveglobal","romance","adventure"]},{"id":"san-blas-guna-yala-panama","jewels":7,"si":["tropical","romance","expedition","culture"]},{"id":"panama-city-panama","jewels":10,"si":["culture","river","romance","adventure","culinary"]}],"orbit_country":[],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Boquete Panama?","a":"**Two oceans from one summit.** **Volcán Barú (3,474 m)** is Panama''s highest point and clears the surrounding ridgelines by enough that, on a genuinely cloud-free morning, both the **Pacific to the south and the Caribbean to the north** are visible — a claim no other summit on the continent makes. Truly clear summits are rare even in dry season, which is why climbers go pre-dawn.","source":"https://outerexperiences.com/blogs/noticias/two-oceans-one-summit-the-complete-guide-to-hiking-volcan-baru-panamas-highest-peak","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"How do I get to Boquete Panama?","a":"**Quetzals nest in the cloud forest, March–June.** The **Sendero Los Quetzales** (the Quetzal Trail), ~9.6 km linking Boquete''s Bajo Mono to Cerro Punta inside Volcán Barú National Park, is renowned for resplendent quetzals nesting in dead-tree cavities and wild-avocado groves **March through June**, when males show their spectacular long tail feathers.","source":"https://www.journeyera.com/sendero-los-quetzales-trail/","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Boquete Panama?","a":"Volcán Barú summit sunrise (3,474m — two oceans) — The pre-dawn guided climb to Panama''s roof; on a clear morning, both the Pacific and Caribbean in view.","source":"https://www.explore-share.com/trip/climb-volcan-baru-3474m-highest-peak-panama-boquete/"}]}'::jsonb, 14),
