m, humpbacks Dec-Mar, Careyes polo/events season, ultra-villa demand highest)","shoulder":"May & late Oct (warm, quieter, pre/post rains)","green":"Jul-Oct (hot/humid, emerald hills, hurricane window May-Nov, softer rates)","event_peak":"Careyes polo late-Nov->end-Apr (Agua Alta Cup at Easter); Ondalinda x Careyes Nov 12-15 2026","out_of_season_fill_the_beds":"green season (Jul-Oct) eco/wildlife (turtle nesting, biosphere), sportfishing, storm-quiet villa buyouts at softer rates - the ''secret season''","sources":["https://mexiconewsdaily.com/travel/an-insiders-guide-to-the-perfect-weekend-in-costalegre/","https://www.ondalinda.com/festivals/careyes/","https://www.costalegre.ca/"],"fire_date":"content-only - no campaign; if founder rules carve-out for private-airstrip enclaves, open winter/holiday villa campaigns in spring for following Nov-Apr peak (6-12-mo lead)","event_peaks":"Christmas-New Year (ultra premium), Semana Santa/Easter (Agua Alta Cup polo), Ondalinda (mid-Nov), winter polo season","booking_lead":"ultra villas for Christmas-New Year/winter holidays book 6-12 months ahead, contracted direct on application; green-season windows far shorter"},"jewels":[{"name":"Careyes clifftop Castles & Iconic Villas","status":"future","tier":"ultra","bookable":"Careyes reservations / villa specialist","source":"https://careyes.com/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"staffed clifftop villas with moat-like infinity pools; Heidi Klum married here, celebrities vacation here","si":"ultra","blurb":"staffed clifftop villas with moat-like infinity pools; Heidi Klum married here, celebrities vacation here","when":"year-round","commission":"on application / villa specialist","wells":["activities","stay"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["ultra"],"shelf_fit":{"ocean":"destination","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination","ultra":"primary"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{